{"id":"n62777-1-12","stage":1,"title":"병 · 瓶子","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62777-1-12-1","ko":"부엌 바닥에 이 유리는 뭐야?","zh":"厨房地板上的这个玻璃碎片是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부엌","meaning":"厨房","explanation":"부엌：厨房","readings":[{"term":"부엌","audio":"/audio/332e6d9dbea912568fe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62273","senseId":"1","lemma":"부엌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부엌","audio":"/audio/332e6d9dbea912568fe5.mp3"}},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"유리는","meaning":"玻璃","explanation":"유리：玻璃；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유리","audio":"/audio/4b585bc5692d408917f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70459","senseId":"1","lemma":"유리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유리는","audio":"/audio/3d24fe8a31d722921fdf.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"332e6d9dbea91256","term":"부엌","zh":"厨房","audio":"/audio/332e6d9dbea912568fe5.mp3","entryId":"62273","definition":"家里做跟吃饭有关的事情的场所，比如准备饭菜、洗碗等。","pronunciation":["부억"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4b585bc5692d4089","term":"유리","zh":"玻璃","audio":"/audio/4b585bc5692d408917f2.mp3","entryId":"70459","definition":"透明坚硬易碎的物质，被用来做窗户或镜子等。","pronunciation":["유리"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/4df6610f06ddfc2d3910.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62777-1-12-2","ko":"애들이 장난치다가 병을 깨뜨렸어요.","zh":"是孩子们玩耍时打碎的瓶子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애들이","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들이","audio":"/audio/e00062397e6f96302405.mp3"}},{"text":"장난치다가","meaning":"闹着玩，开玩笑","explanation":"장난치다：闹着玩，开玩笑；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"장난치다","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75063","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난치다가","audio":"/audio/d3ca7998ceb5618f7235.mp3"}},{"text":"병을","meaning":"瓶子，瓶","explanation":"병：瓶子，瓶；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62777","senseId":"1","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병을","audio":"/audio/72b58c8ef0644a3f4361.mp3"}},{"text":"깨뜨렸어요.","meaning":"打破，打碎","explanation":"깨뜨리다：打破，打碎；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"깨뜨리다","audio":"/audio/7be69fd41e80264c2c7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32562","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨뜨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨뜨렸어요","audio":"/audio/b9a1a402584701608bb1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"b7e4917842610b07","term":"장난치다","zh":"闹着玩，开玩笑","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3","entryId":"75063","definition":"孩子们为了好玩或消遣而闹得很厉害。","pronunciation":["장난치다"]},{"id":"31eaf1068c99d7f1","term":"병","zh":"瓶子，瓶","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3","entryId":"62777","definition":"主要用来装液体或粉末的、颈部细长的容器。","pronunciation":["병"]},{"id":"7be69fd41e80264c","term":"깨뜨리다","zh":"打破，打碎","audio":"/audio/7be69fd41e80264c2c7d.mp3","entryId":"32562","definition":"击打坚硬的东西，使它碎成多块儿。","pronunciation":["깨뜨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d0ba83c6e04b4d475da.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.551,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62777","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.874,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["厨房地板上为什么有水？","厨房地板上的这个玻璃碎片是什么？","厨房桌子上的这个玻璃杯是谁的？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["孩子们把瓶子从地上捡起来了。","是我洗碗的时候打碎的盘子。","是孩子们玩耍时打碎的瓶子啊。"],"answer":2}]}
